   "modifications": [
    "Merged all 37 plays into one graph, summing scene co-presence across plays.",
    "Dropped group nodes (crowds, attendants) so a waking is always a person.",
    "Disambiguated repeated generic names (Messenger, Soldier) with the play title.",
    "Dropped unnamed crowd roles that no play-level qualifier can tell apart.",
    "Dropped ties weaker than 1 and characters with fewer than 2 ties, then kept every component of at least 8 characters (871 nodes and 4546 ties in, 830 and 4518 out).",
    "Split the corpus into one universe per connected component of at least 8 characters, shipping each of the 28 resulting worlds as its own file, since no character links one to another.",
    "Added a normalised rank per tie endpoint so thickness reads relative to each character's own ties rather than raw counts.",
    "Computed a force-directed layout for the full graph, used by the reveal animation."
   ]
  },
